  "body": "Remove the \"element-attr\" definition type from the terms \"form control maxlength attribute\" and \"form control minlength attribute\", which are not attributes.\r\n\r\nThis would not cause a normative change to the spec. It would just ensure that the \"data-*\" attributes are consistent with the rest of the spec, since the \"element-attr\" definition type is only applied to the actual defining instances of the content attributes. This would address #9116.\r\n\r\nEDIT: Sorry. I forgot to add my name as requested, and I did not sign the WHATWG agreement prior to making the pull request.",
